s:676722:"{
"lastpushid": 514,
"pushes": {"262": {"changesets": [{"author": "Masayuki Nakano \u003cmasayuki@d-toybox.com\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_60_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1510183 - Make HTMLEditor treat empty string attribute of style as nullptr of nsAtom rather than nsGkAtoms::_empty. r=m_kato a=jorgk DONTBUILD\n\nAfter fixing bug 1427060, HTMLEditor treats attribute of style as nullptr.\nHowever, if empty string is used to call NS_Atomize(), it returns\nnsGkAtoms::_empty.  Therefore, HTMLEditor fails to check whether attribute is\nspecified or not with nullptr check since some root callers sets\nnsGkAtoms::_empty instead of nullptr.\n\nThis patch makes HTMLEditor always use nullptr for empty string of attribute\nof style with wrapping NS_Atomize() with AtomzieAttribute().  Additionally,\nfor safer change, this patch makes PropItem and TypeInState treat\nnsGkAtom::_empty as nullptr.", "files": ["editor/libeditor/HTMLStyleEditor.cpp", "editor/libeditor/TypeInState.cpp", "editor/libeditor/tests/mochitest.ini", "editor/libeditor/tests/test_nsIHTMLEditor_removeInlineProperty.html", "editor/nsIHTMLEditor.idl"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5311a17b136e5e3370f686ffa18fe2deebc44cfe", "parents": ["42791ed044618b41dac82fe85d0c10655511e2ee"], "tags": []}], "date": 1543865800, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "mozilla@jorgk.com"}, "263": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jorg K \u003cjorgk@jorgk.com\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_60_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Backed out changeset 300efdbc9fe1 (bug 1475775 for causing bug 1510212) to build Thunderbird 60.3.3. a=jorgk DONTBUILD", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/nsNSSComponent.cpp", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_sdr_upgraded_with_password.js", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_sdr_upgraded_with_password/cert8.db", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_sdr_upgraded_with_password/cert9.db", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_sdr_upgraded_with_password/key3.db", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_sdr_upgraded_with_password/ke